    "description": "Special benefits only available at Twomix! \r\nA variety of fun is coming to you now!\r\n\r\n\u203b Adult content cannot be used in the Google Play Two Mix app.\r\n\r\n\u25c6 Check attendance every day \r\nYou can receive free coins and a lucky roulette ticket just by attending!\r\n\r\n\u25c6 Just wait a moment and it\u2019s free!\r\nA golden opportunity to enjoy high-quality paid webtoons for free, only for me!   \r\n\r\n\u25c6 Make the most of your benefits!\r\nGenerous discount events and gift boxes piling up every day!\r\n\r\n\u25c6 Quickly with one cut!\r\nA quick and simple parade of famous scenes, a photo that stands out!\r\n\r\n\u25c6 Comfortable for everyone! \r\nSuper-fast membership registration in just 3 seconds and easy login to SNS!\r\n\r\n[Toomics usage inquiry]\r\n- Inquiries regarding payment, coins, etc.: Customer Center within the app > Contact us or help@toomics.com\r\n- Customer Center (1666-4614) Business hours: Monday - Friday 10:00 AM - 7:00 PM\r\n\r\n[Information on app selection access rights]\r\n\r\n- Contact information (address book) \r\n  : Permission required when using a free charging station.\r\n\r\n- Repository (required for Android 13 and below)\r\n  : Permission to attach screenshots when making 1:1 inquiries.\r\n\r\n- Notifications (required on Android 13 and above)\r\n  : Permission to receive event information notifications.\r\n\r\n\u203bEven if you do not necessarily agree to the optional access permissions, there is no problem using the app other than the corresponding function.\r\n\r\n[Information on consent to collection of personal information]\r\nThe following information is collected and used to check participation information for Apppang advertisements within the Tomix app and provide rewards.\r\n\r\nItems of personal information collected: Google login ID\r\n\r\n\u203bYou may refuse to consent to the collection of personal information, and if you do not agree, use of the service will be restricted.",
